WEBVTT

00:00:00.298 --> 00:00:00.758
WHERE'S HERMIONE?

00:00:00.802 --> 00:00:03.500
PARVATI PATIL SAID
THAT SHE WOULDN'T COME OUT

00:00:03.543 --> 00:00:05.154
OF THE GIRLS' BATHROOM.

00:00:05.197 --> 00:00:07.112
SHE SAID THAT SHE'D BEEN
IN THERE ALL AFTERNOON

00:00:07.156 --> 00:00:08.723
CRYING.

00:00:13.858 --> 00:00:14.903
TROLL!

00:00:14.946 --> 00:00:16.992
IN THE DUNGEON!

00:00:17.035 --> 00:00:19.342
TROLL IN THE DUNGEON!

00:00:23.476 --> 00:00:25.087
THOUGHT YOU OUGHT TO KNOW.

00:00:27.045 --> 00:00:29.787
AAH! AAH!

00:00:29.831 --> 00:00:31.528
AAH!

00:00:32.529 --> 00:00:35.662
SILENCE!

00:00:37.055 --> 00:00:41.843
EVERYONE WILL PLEASE NOT PANIC.

00:00:41.886 --> 00:00:43.192
NOW...

00:00:43.235 --> 00:00:45.803
PREFECTS
WILL LEAD THEIR HOUSE

00:00:45.847 --> 00:00:48.327
BACK TO THE DORMITORIES.

00:00:48.371 --> 00:00:52.636
TEACHERS WILL FOLLOW ME
TO THE DUNGEONS.

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:55.117
HUFFLEPUFF,
THIS WAY!

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.466
STAY TOGETHER!

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.606
GRYFFINDORS,
KEEP UP, PLEASE,

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.086
AND STAY ALERT.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.784
HOW COULD
A TROLL GET IN?

00:01:09.827 --> 00:01:10.959
NOT ON ITS OWN.

00:01:11.002 --> 00:01:12.961
TROLLS ARE
REALLY STUPID.

00:01:13.004 --> 00:01:15.224
PROBABLY PEOPLE
PLAYING JOKES.

00:01:15.267 --> 00:01:16.225
WHAT?

00:01:16.268 --> 00:01:18.618
HERMIONE!
SHE DOESN'T KNOW.

00:01:29.934 --> 00:01:31.414
[FOOTSTEPS THUDDING]

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:33.982
I THINK THE TROLL
HAS LEFT THE DUNGEON.

00:01:34.025 --> 00:01:35.810
[TROLL GRUNTING]

00:01:38.856 --> 00:01:40.945
IT'S GOING INTO
THE GIRLS' BATHROOM.

00:01:52.652 --> 00:01:53.958
[GRUNTS]

00:01:56.439 --> 00:01:58.441
[GROWLING]

00:02:05.927 --> 00:02:07.015
AAH!

00:02:11.802 --> 00:02:13.021
HERMIONE, MOVE!

00:02:17.373 --> 00:02:19.897
Hermione: HELP!

00:02:19.941 --> 00:02:21.551
Hermione: HELP!

00:02:23.466 --> 00:02:25.860
HEY, PEA BRAIN!

00:02:34.259 --> 00:02:35.434
[GROWLS]

00:02:35.478 --> 00:02:37.045
AAH!

00:02:38.133 --> 00:02:39.264
HELP!

00:02:42.615 --> 00:02:43.616
WHOA!

00:02:48.665 --> 00:02:49.971
WHOA, WHOA!

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:53.191
EW!

00:02:55.106 --> 00:02:56.107
[SNORTS]

00:02:57.979 --> 00:02:59.589
WHOA, WHOA, WHOA!

00:03:01.243 --> 00:03:02.592
DO SOMETHING!

00:03:02.635 --> 00:03:03.767
[GROWLS]

00:03:05.073 --> 00:03:06.726
WHAT?

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:08.250
ANYTHING!

00:03:09.512 --> 00:03:10.469
HURRY UP!

00:03:10.513 --> 00:03:12.384
SWISH AND FLICK.

00:03:12.428 --> 00:03:14.734
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSA.

00:03:17.737 --> 00:03:19.087
HMM...

00:03:21.654 --> 00:03:22.655
HUH?

00:03:25.571 --> 00:03:26.572
COOL.

00:03:30.141 --> 00:03:31.969
OH...

00:03:37.409 --> 00:03:40.978
[COUGHING]

00:03:52.033 --> 00:03:54.949
IS IT...DEAD?

00:03:54.992 --> 00:03:56.472
I DON'T THINK SO.

00:03:56.515 --> 00:03:58.300
JUST KNOCKED OUT.

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.000
[GRUNTING]

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:06.656
OH! TROLL BOGIES.

00:04:08.005 --> 00:04:10.007
OH!

00:04:10.051 --> 00:04:11.835
OH, MY GOODNESS.

00:04:11.878 --> 00:04:13.968
EXPLAIN YOURSELVES,
BOTH OF YOU!

00:04:14.011 --> 00:04:15.273
Both: WELL, WHAT IT IS--

00:04:15.317 --> 00:04:17.667
IT'S MY FAULT,
PROFESSOR McGONAGALL.

00:04:20.017 --> 00:04:21.976
MISS GRANGER.

00:04:22.019 --> 00:04:24.108
I WENT LOOKING
FOR THE TROLL.

00:04:24.152 --> 00:04:25.588
I'D READ
ABOUT THEM

00:04:25.631 --> 00:04:27.633
AND THOUGHT
I COULD HANDLE IT,

00:04:27.677 --> 00:04:29.853
BUT I WAS WRONG.

00:04:29.896 --> 00:04:32.943
IF HARRY AND RON HADN'T
COME AND FOUND ME,

00:04:32.987 --> 00:04:35.293
I'D PROBABLY BE DEAD.

00:04:35.337 --> 00:04:37.687
McGonagall:
BE THAT AS IT MAY...

00:04:37.730 --> 00:04:40.603
IT WAS AN EXTREMELY
FOOLISH THING TO DO.

00:04:40.646 --> 00:04:43.258
I WOULD HAVE EXPECTED MORE
RATIONAL BEHAVIOR ON YOUR PART,

00:04:43.301 --> 00:04:46.522
AND I AM VERY DISAPPOINTED
IN YOU, MISS GRANGER.

00:04:46.565 --> 00:04:49.046
5 POINTS WILL BE TAKEN
FROM GRYFFINDOR

00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:52.484
FOR YOUR SERIOUS
LACK OF JUDGMENT.

00:04:54.225 --> 00:04:55.922
AS FOR YOU
TWO GENTLEMEN--

00:04:55.966 --> 00:04:58.925
I JUST HOPE YOU REALIZE
HOW FORTUNATE YOU ARE.

00:04:58.969 --> 00:05:01.580
NOT MANY FIRST-YEAR
STUDENTS COULD TAKE ON

00:05:01.624 --> 00:05:03.321
A FULLY-GROWN
MOUNTAIN TROLL

00:05:03.365 --> 00:05:05.976
AND LIVE
TO TELL THE TALE.

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:08.283
5 POINTS...

00:05:09.327 --> 00:05:12.548
WILL BE AWARDED
TO EACH OF YOU...

00:05:14.376 --> 00:05:17.161
FOR SHEER DUMB LUCK.

00:05:23.385 --> 00:05:24.821
PERHAPS YOU OUGHT TO GO.

00:05:24.864 --> 00:05:25.822
M-MIGHT WAKE UP.

00:05:25.865 --> 00:05:26.866
[LAUGHS]

00:05:29.434 --> 00:05:30.392
[GROWLS]

00:05:30.435 --> 00:05:31.741
OH!

00:05:31.784 --> 00:05:32.785
[LAUGHS]

00:05:34.439 --> 00:05:37.355
Ron: TAKE A BIT OF
TOAST, MATE. GO ON.

00:05:37.399 --> 00:05:39.314
RON'S RIGHT, HARRY.

00:05:39.357 --> 00:05:41.446
YOU'RE GONNA NEED
YOUR STRENGTH TODAY.

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:42.882
I'M NOT HUNGRY.

00:05:44.101 --> 00:05:46.408
GOOD LUCK TODAY, POTTER.

00:05:47.626 --> 00:05:48.758
THEN AGAIN, NOW THAT
YOU'VE PROVEN YOURSELF

00:05:48.801 --> 00:05:50.368
AGAINST A TROLL,
A LITTLE GAME

00:05:50.412 --> 00:05:53.241
OF QUIDDITCH SHOULD BE
EASY WORK FOR YOU...

00:05:53.284 --> 00:05:55.765
EVEN IF IT IS
AGAINST SLYTHERIN.

00:06:04.208 --> 00:06:06.341
THAT EXPLAINS THE BLOOD.

00:06:06.384 --> 00:06:07.733
BLOOD?

00:06:07.777 --> 00:06:10.127
LISTEN. LAST NIGHT,

00:06:10.171 --> 00:06:11.737
I'M GUESSING SNAPE
LET THE TROLL IN

00:06:11.781 --> 00:06:12.825
AS A DIVERSION

00:06:12.869 --> 00:06:13.337
SO HE COULD TRY
AND GET PAST
